<title>FRANCE: GEC Alsthom gets 30 mln Ecu Egypt pumping contract.</title>
<headline>GEC Alsthom gets 30 mln Ecu Egypt pumping contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said on Monday it had won a contract worth about 30 million Ecus to renovate three pumping stations for the ministry of public works in El Nasr in Egypt.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the project would be managed by GEC Alsthom ACB's Bergeron unit.</p>
</text>
